<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34230" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπαρ-έχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hand over</i> to another, <i>put into</i> his
				<i>power</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν ἐμπαρασχόντες προκινδυνεῦσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.56
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲ τούτῳ ἐμπαράσχητε . .
				ἐλλαμπρύνεσθαι</span>
			<i>put into</i> his <i>power, allow</i> him to gain distinction,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἑαυτόν τινι</span>
			<i>give</i> oneself <i>up</i> as his tool, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				5.68
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπαρασχεῖν ἑαυτὸν τοιούτῳ
				τινί</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείπνῳ</span>)
				<i>accept an invitation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Symp.</u>
				28
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτὶ τὸν θίασον . . εὔνουν ἑαυτὸν
					-εχόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Rev.Arch.</u>
					22(1925).64
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Callatis</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.127
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>supply, furnish</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῇ τέρψιν,
				δυνάμεις τισί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.383
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Galb.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			.</div>
